&lt;li&gt;Participate in architectural discussions and code reviews, actively contributing to elevating our engineering standards and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify bottlenecks, optimize database queries, and continuously improve system performance and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace a &#39;you build it, you run it&#39; approach, ensuring our production environments remain highly stable and observable.&lt;/li&gt;
