&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Relational Databases and good SQL skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, with a passion for quickly learning new technologies and working effectively in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading large-scale features from end-to-end is a significant plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
