&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Corporate Finance Manager to join our dynamic finance team. This individual will independently manage financial projects, build and maintain complex financial models, and play a key role in producing high-impact presentation materials for executive and board-level audiences. If you’re skilled in financial modeling, presentation creation, and excited about leveraging technology to drive forecasts, you’ll thrive here!&lt;/p&gt;
