&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and enhance complex financial and forecasting models to support strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-level presentation materials, including board decks, financial commentary, and visualizations that clearly communicate financial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze financial data and trends to provide actionable insights to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to ensure alignment on financial goals and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize forecasting and planning tools to support company-wide financial initiatives and enhance predictive accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support long-range and annual financial planning processes including income statement, balance sheet, and cash flow modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-level presentation materials, including board decks, financial commentary, and visualizations that clearly communicate financial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
