&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in finance, accounting, economics or a quantitative discipline (Masters is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, corporate finance, or a related field, ideally in a SaaS or tech-driven company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently manage projects and deliver results in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced skills in presentation design and storytelling for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of financial modeling, analysis, and a deep understanding of all three financial statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with forecasting tools (e.g., Adaptive Planning, Anaplan) and data visualization platforms (e.g., Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technologically savvy with the ability to quickly grasp new tools and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, and a team-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
