&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on software development in a cloud-oriented organization, building and owning production services or tools end to end (design, code, tests, review, maintenance). B.Sc. in Computer Science or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record of initiating, designing, implementing and leading meaningful projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one general-purpose language: Python, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin or Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with at least two of the following: CI/CD pipelines (Jenkins preferred), Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform), Kubernetes and containers, AWS or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of AI development tools beyond autocomplete: working with coding agents (e.g. Claude Code, Cursor), connecting them to MCP servers, and building custom instructions and workflows into daily development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product mindset and a people person: cares about the developers using their work, is accessible and easy to work with, and thinks in terms of adoption and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proficient problem solver who quickly adapts to new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
