&lt;li&gt;Someone curious about how search, media, and AI shape brand discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone excited to build a new capability with measurable business impact&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
