&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills to assist with customer needs, problem solve, answer questions, and leave a positive impression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Property &amp;amp; Casualty Insurance License (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Unstoppable Qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal standard for excellence: Strong process orientation and interest in finding better ways to do things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fearlessness and adaptability in a fast-moving, ever changing environment and ability to work on multiple tasks at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and comfort using a variety of software tools from Excel and G Suite, to policy management and accounting systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual (Spanish)&lt;/li&gt;
