&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Technical Product to translate business priorities into shipped product and pricing changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support product filings, working with Actuarial and Compliance to bring updates to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze product and portfolio performance, identify improvement opportunities, and drive measurable impact on growth and loss ratio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct competitive and market research, incorporating customer and agent feedback into actionable product enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Actuarial, Data Science, Claims, Legal, and Operations to align execution with underwriting and profitability goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product updates and performance clearly to leadership and key internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
