&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in using data driven methods in decision making and strong analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing and pricing casualty products using data, modeling, and loss ratio analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity, creative in building solutions, and rigorous in execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communication skills for both technical and non-technical leadership audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and capable of managing multiple workstreams across multiple functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree; advanced degree (MBA, MS) or insurance certifications (e.g., CPCU) are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
