&lt;li&gt;Workers&#39; Compensation Mastery: 5+ years of experience in Workers Compensation product with deep, practical understanding of WC insurance, class code assignment, premium calculation, navigating bureau manuals and rate/form revisions ensuring changes meet appropriate regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Underwriting Acumen: Working knowledge of WC underwriting principles, portfolio and the automated underwriting process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management and Process optimization: PMP, Six Sigma or equivalent certifications preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics and monitoring: Experience with Jira, Figma, Tableau and AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: Communication skills that motivate team members and drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in insurance, business, finance, STEM, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
