&lt;p&gt;We are growing fast and looking for an actuary who wants to help shape how we manage our product portfolio, not just analyze it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have real autonomy and the latitude to act on your expertise as a trusted partner to our insurance product managers, bringing sound recommendations to leadership backed by rigorous analysis. You will be close to the business day to day, with a clear view of where the line stands and where it is headed, and a direct role in the decisions that shape its growth and profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the #1 subject matter expert at Next related to the pricing of the target product offerings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance actuarial methodologies around loss ratio forecast, insurance analytics, and P&amp;amp;L management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Insurance Product Managers to drive future product developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build go-to-market predictive models in Akur8, perform impact analyses, and support product filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform competitor and market research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with data science and data engineering to enable future-proof data architecture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actuarially sound recommendations to senior management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ad hoc support to other business partners, including but not limited to reinsurance, finance, distribution, claims, and growth teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FCAS preferred, ACAS accepted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of actuarial experience; property &amp;amp; casualty insurance and product management experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability and pride in own work product: instill confidence in leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and collaboration: work effectively with cross functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gritty, self-driven mindset: embrace challenges and are excited about unexplored possibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity: dig deep and solve complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset: identify business needs and drive solutions to meet them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with some or all of the following software: Tableau, SQL, Python, MS Office, Google Suite, Akur8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
