&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Rochester, NY (hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NEXT’s mission is to help entrepreneurs thrive. We’re doing that by building the only technology-led, full-stack provider of small business insurance in the industry, taking on the entire value chain and transforming the customer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
