&lt;p&gt;The Lead Insurance Advisor supports NEXT Insurance’s vision by leading a high-performing, customer-focused Service team and ensuring excellence across the full customer policy lifecycle. This role is responsible for daily team performance, SLA attainment, and fostering a positive, accountable culture where Insurance Advisors are empowered to deliver exceptional service. They maintain deep knowledge of our insurance products and support escalations to ensure timely and effective resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In partnership with the Service Department Manager and cross-functional teams, the Insurance Advisor Lead identifies opportunities to improve processes, reduce friction, and enhance the overall customer experience. They are forward-thinking in leveraging technology, automation, and AI-driven tools to improve operational efficiency, team productivity, and service delivery in the SMB insurance space.&lt;/p&gt;
