&lt;li&gt;Directly manage an assigned team of Insurance Advisors and collaborate cross-functionally with other teams and leadership to improve service delivery across the policy lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor phone, chat, Slack, and ticket queues in real-time, leveraging data and technology tools to make necessary adjustments to achieve daily goals. This includes developing tactics, tracking individual development through 1:1 meetings, individual development plans, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular team meetings to communicate team goals, performance updates, upcoming events/training, product updates, process enhancements, and overall company direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answer questions, assist with complex problems, and ensure work complies with quality standards and guidelines, while identifying opportunities for automation, AI support, and skills enhancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain a culture of teamwork and collaboration, fostering growth and removing obstacles to enable Insurance Advisors to focus on delivering exceptional customer service through efficient, tech-enabled workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide quality customer service by interacting with customers, addressing inquiries, and effectively handling escalations, while capturing insights to inform cross-functional improvements and smarter operational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an active P&amp;amp;C license and minimum 2 years relevant experience in insurance and customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong customer focus and service leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and effectively, both verbally and in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be results-driven with strong organizational and prioritization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify problems and recommends process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think strategically about service impact across the policy lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable leveraging technology, automation, and AI to enhance operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Posses strong industry and product knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
