&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Palo Alto, CA or Waltham, MA (hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small business owners don&#39;t have a risk department. They spend their time and energy starting and growing a business. NEXT&#39;s mission is to help entrepreneurs thrive, and we&#39;re using AI to make business insurance simple, fast, and affordable enough that it never costs them a day of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an AI technology company that happens to also be a fully licensed insurance carrier. Because we&#39;re a full-stack carrier, AI isn&#39;t a layer bolted onto someone else&#39;s product. It&#39;s in the underwriting, the pricing, the classification, and increasingly in how the product itself gets built. We&#39;re rebuilding the core judgment loops of a hundreds-of-years old industry, and doing it with a lean team, which is exactly why AI matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We underwrite our own risk, build our own systems, and own the entire value chain, so the product decisions made here show up directly in what a customer pays and how fast they get covered. Since 2016 we&#39;ve insured hundreds of thousands of small businesses across the country. As a subsidiary of Munich Re and ERGO, our growth is backed by the financial strength of one of the world&#39;s leading reinsurance and insurance groups.&lt;/p&gt;
